---
description: Enforce cinematic and emotionally resonant first-touch experience
globs: ["**"]
alwaysApply: true
ruleType: Always
---

* All first-time user flows must include a cinematic overlay, onboarding step, or emotional guidance moment.  
* Do not remove expectation scaffolds (e.g., “What to Expect” UI) from discovery funnels or previews.  
* First output experiences must build confidence and clarity — never drop raw content without context or reassurance.  
* Any changes to first-touch UX must be validated against `/docs/ideal-cx-thread.md`.  
* The goal is for the user to feel seen, curious, supported, and excited — this must not degrade under system changes.  

